        "evidence": "Driven in headless Chromium over CDP against a repo with 300 branches: search narrows, Enter picks, 'no match' shows; a commit search for 'gloss' narrowed the list and 'zzzz' showed the empty message. test/ary.test.ts covers the server side.",
