        "notes": "Added at the user's request after the first version, so it is part of the task now; graded supporting because the browser can browse without it. The picker is a combobox of about 110 lines plus its styles, since a native select can't be searched. Pickers match all space-separated words and show 200 at a time; commit search is debounced and runs on the server so it covers the whole branch. Search results are ordered by commit date (--no-walk=sorted), which can differ from an unfiltered log's order when dates are skewed. The server half is the query branch of listLog in browse.ts: two git log passes (--grep and --author), merged and paged by hand. It exists only for search."
